    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "x1F is in the German Camunda cohort on size alone. The resolved facts are EUR 177.7m in revenue and a Lunendonk rank of 21; the Camunda attribution is unverified and the assessment records the firm's positioning as unresolved.\n\nRecording that honestly is more useful than filling the gap with a guess. Two of the three things that would make this lead interesting \u2014 what it runs and what it sells itself as \u2014 are unknown, and the third, its size, is the axis on which large firms in this set are usually deprioritised. It sits at priority 3 with verification as the next step, and if the Camunda footprint does not confirm, the entry has no remaining basis.\n\n---\n\n## Leads sharing this finding (1)\n\n**3 \u00b7 later**\n- x1F (DE)\n\nVerbatim research text this claim was extracted from:\n\n> EUR 177.7m, Lunendonk rank 21, positioning unresolved.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T11:29:24.395847Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:29:24.395851Z"
    }
